   - **Data Structures:** Ensure that the interfaces and class methods operate solely on single responsibility principles. For instance, consider refactoring the responsibility of loading data from files to a dedicated data handler class for better separation of concerns and easier maintenance. This class could handle reading from and writing to text files while encapsulating the logic required to maintain data integrity. 

By addressing these areas, the SocialLearn application can improve its robustness, user interaction, and overall architecture, which will lead to a better maintainable and user-friendly application.
