### Passed Test Cases
1. |Case|:**user_login**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION user_login()
    IF POST_REQUEST
        GET username FROM request
        GET password FROM request
        LOAD users FROM users.txt

        IF username EXISTS IN users AND password MATCHES
            SET session[username] = username
            REDIRECT to /profile
        ELSE
            FLASH "Login Failed: Invalid username or password."
    ENDIF
    RENDER login.html
END FUNCTION
```
2. |Case|:**user_logout**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION logout()
    REMOVE session[username]
    FLASH "You have been logged out."
    REDIRECT to /
END FUNCTION
```
3. |Case|:**user_profile_management**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION profile()
    IF username NOT IN session
        REDIRECT to /
    ENDIF
    
    GET username FROM session
    LOAD profiles FROM profiles.txt

    IF POST_REQUEST
        GET interests FROM request
        SPLIT interests INTO list
        CREATE Profile object WITH username
        CALL update() METHOD ON Profile object

    RENDER profile.html WITH username AND interests
END FUNCTION
```
4. |Case|:**user_registration**
```pseudocode
FUNCTION register()
    IF POST_REQUEST
        GET username FROM request
        GET password FROM request
        LOAD users FROM users.txt

        IF username EXISTS IN users
            FLASH "Registration Failed: Username already exists."
            REDIRECT to /register
        ELSE
            CREATE User object WITH username AND password
            CALL save() METHOD ON User object
            FLASH "Registration successful! Please log in."
            REDIRECT to /
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    RENDER registration.html
END FUNCTION
```
